# Internal build/planning docs — local-only, not part of the public repo.
# Still live on disk; the nightly monitoring task reads/writes them
# directly, no git involved for these. Consolidated into one folder
# (2026-07-25) so this entry doesn't itself list what's inside.
_local/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

